# Build outputs: `go build ./cmd/...` without -o drops the binary in the
# package directory, and `scripts/build.sh` writes to bin/. Neither belongs in
# the repository - a committed binary is 14 MB of stale arm64 code that the next
# reader will mistake for source of truth.
